      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Lightly raced four-year-old WILLEBOB (5) showed a maiden win was not far away when he ran the in-form Strong Minded to a neck last start over 1300m at this track. Very fit now and gets all the favours out of the inside alley. This looks a perfect set up. PRETTY MORSEL (10) registered her fourth minor placing in a row, and eighth overall, when she finished a distant second over the mile here a fortnight ago after leading. Nicely placed back to this trip and should give them something to catch. LEADING RIDE (8) has raced just twice and been beaten less than a length on each occasion in BM64 races after travelling on the pace. Particularly well-placed back in maiden company. Sure to play a key role. ATOMIC TIME (1) was excellent two back at the first run for the new stable then struggled here recently over 1050m. Worth another chance out to this trip. IAMTHEDEVILSELBOW (2) ran a better race at Mt Gambier last time and is a nice trifecta and first four option.",
